      ogDescription="A decentralized network with the radically better user &amp; developer experience needed for everyone to confidently use Web3 &amp; DeFi."
      ogImage="https://www.radixdlt.com/assets/671f6bde046afdebc5f2c15a_OPENGRAPH-1.png"
      twitterTitle="Radix DLT | Radically Better Web3"
      twitterDescription="A decentralized network with the radically better user &amp; developer experience needed for everyone to confidently use Web3 &amp; DeFi."
      twitterImage="https://www.radixdlt.com/assets/671f6bde046afdebc5f2c15a_OPENGRAPH-1.png"
